Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\fad(500,0)\fn方正兰亭细黑_GBK\blur3\bord3\b1\\i1\c&HEAD60F&\3c&HB17700&\pos(1485,605)}胸圍 : 83.7
